<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 13-mth bond auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 13-mth bond auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday 13-month bonds (392-days) second time after last week's 13-month auction on December 17.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : January 21, 1998</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: December 24, 1996</p>
<p>Value date  : December 25, 1996</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75 ATA</p>
</text>
